## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Execution Environment**:
> A Docker Compose setup (`docker-compose.yml`) will be provided for running PostgreSQL (`localhost:5432`) and Redis (`localhost:6379`).
> To guarantee that test suites and local execution run out-of-the-box in environments where Docker or a PostgreSQL service might not yet be started, the repository layer and test harness will support both live PostgreSQL via Prisma and a resilient in-memory/isolated test runner for zero-downtime development and testing.

> [!NOTE]
> **Frontend Compatibility**:
> The existing frontend in `src/` will be completely supported. Both `POST /api/jobs/:jobId/apply` (spec #31) and `POST /api/applications` (frontend client) will be routed to the same transaction-safe application submission service.

